theorem bitwise_eqs_p16 (J: class) (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec: expr): $ bitwise_eqs_j J G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec $ > $ deq_j J (cons nat_ty (cons nat_ty (cons (pi B (pi B B)) G))) (app (app (app fb (bvar n2)) (bvar n1)) (bvar nz)) (app (app (app (app (app fix al) motive) hm) (app Fb (bvar n2))) (app (app pack (bvar n1)) (bvar nz))) nat_ty $;

