  $ _ ⇒ hind H $ > $ _ ⇒ hlit ⊆ H $ > $ bitop_eqs_j (jmod (mcv H)) G B vt vf Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub fp fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec f bf vt vt vt vf $ > $ bor ba bb bc $ >
  $ mdeq (mcv H) G (app (app f (lit ba)) (lit bb)) (lit bc) nat_ty $;

